Bind Npc 29072 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29073 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 801 "[Crack of All Means] Fundamental reason"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to the [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Harrigan."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to the [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Marcus."

Requires player level >= 58 and quest 800 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    Say "[Ronarkland]??  Can we make it there? Why is Harrigon located at such a scary place?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Who are you? Why are you looking for me?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Ah.. You are the person who's sent by Herga. Nice to meet you.\n\nFor now, I'll see what I can do. But I need your help.\n\nI have an order from [Advisor] Herga to receive advice from [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Harrigon from Ronarkland."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Who are you? Why are you looking for me?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Ah.. You are the person who's sent by Nez. Nice to meet you.\n\nFor now, I'll see what I can do. But I need your help.\n\nI have an order from [Advisor] Nez to receive advice from [Chief of Order of the Sorcery] Marcus from Ronarkland."

On claimable
    Show quest "For now, I'll see what I can do. But I need your help."
